: "God", "start": 4.4, "end": 4.8}, {"text": "keeping", "start": 4.8, "end": 5.62}, {"text": "your", "start": 5.62, "end": 5.94}, {"text": "hand", "start": 5.94, "end": 6.2}, {"text": "whole.", "start": 6.2, "end": 6.58}], "text": "A warning isn't God being hard on you. It's God keeping your hand whole."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c08.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "I've", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.62}, {"text": "ignored", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.96}, {"text": "some", "start": 0.96, "end": 1.2}, {"text": "warnings", "start": 1.2, "end": 1.54}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.54, "end": 1.78}, {"text": "my", "start": 1.78, "end": 1.9}, {"text": "life.", "start": 1.9, "end": 2.2}, {"text": "Every", "start": 3.5, "end": 4.02}, {"text": "one", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.28}, {"text": "costs", "start": 4.28, "end": 5.42}, {"text": "more", "start": 5.42, "end": 5.8}, {"text": "than", "start": 5.8, "end": 6.04}, {"text": "reading", "start": 6.04, "end": 6.3}, {"text": "it", "start": 6.3, "end": 6.48}, {"text": "would", "start": 6.48, "end": 6.62}, {"text": "have.", "start": 6.62, "end": 6.88}], "text": "I've ignored some warnings in my life. Every one costs more than reading it would have."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c09.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "The", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.56}, {"text": "reward", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.92}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.52}, {"text": "only", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.7}, {"text": "heaven", "start": 1.7, "end": 2.08}, {"text": "later,", "start": 2.08, "end": 2.42}, {"text": "it's", "start": 2.54, "end": 3.72}, {"text": "a", "start": 3.72, "end": 3.78}, {"text": "clear", "start": 3.78, "end": 4.1}, {"text": "head", "start": 4.1, "end": 4.38}, {"text": "tonight,", "start": 4.38, "end": 4.72}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.96, "end": 5.84}, {"text": "house", "start": 5.84, "end": 6.2}, {"text": "still", "start": 6.2, "end": 6.5}, {"text": "standing.", "start": 6.5, "end": 6.96}], "text": "The reward isn't only heaven later, it's a clear head tonight, a house still standing."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c10.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Today,", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.68}, {"text": "read", "start": 0.9, "end": 1.78}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.78, "end": 1.94}, {"text": "warning", "start": 1.94, "end": 2.26}, {"text": "before", "start": 2.26, "end": 2.62}, {"text": "you", "start": 2.62, "end": 2.86}, {"text": "touch", "start": 2.86, "end": 3.1}, {"text": "the", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.28}, {"text": "machine.", "start": 3.28, "end": 3.58}, {"text": "One", "start": 4.42, "end": 5.06}, {"text": "chapter", "start": 5.06, "end": 5.42}, {"text": "before", "start": 5.42, "end": 6.16}, {"text": "one", "start": 6.16, "end": 6.58}, {"text": "app.", "start": 6.58, "end": 6.9}], "text": "Today, read the warning before you touch the machine. One chapter before one app."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c11.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Let's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.7}, {"text": "pray.", "start": 0.7, "end": 0.88}, {"text": "Father,", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.46}, {"text": "thank", "start": 3.54, "end": 3.74}, {"text": "you", "start": 3.74, "end": 3.94}, {"text": "for", "start": 3.94, "end": 4.12}, {"text": "warning", "start": 4.12, "end": 4.44}, {"text": "us", "start": 4.44, "end": 4.7}, {"text": "before", "start": 4.7, "end": 4.98}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.98, "end": 5.2}, {"text": "trouble,", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.52}, {"text": "not", "start": 5.66, "end": 6.28}, {"text": "after.", "start": 6.28, "end": 6.72}], "text": "Let's pray. Father, thank you for warning us before the trouble, not after."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c12.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Open", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.72}, {"text": "our", "start": 0.72, "end": 1.0}, {"text": "eyes", "start": 1.0, "end": 1.52}, {"text": "to", "start": 1.52, "end": 2.0}, {"text": "the", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.12}, {"text": "Word", "start": 2.12, "end": 2.46}, {"text": "today", "start": 2.46, "end": 3.08}, {"text": "and", "start": 3.08, "end": 4.36}, {"text": "give", "start": 4.36, "end": 4.7}, {"text": "us", "start": 4.7, "end": 4.98}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.98, "end": 5.16}, {"text": "grit", "start": 5.16, "end": 5.56}, {"text": "to", "start": 5.56, "end": 5.96}, {"text": "keep", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.54}, {"text": "it.", "start": 6.54, "end": 6.84}], "text": "Open our eyes to the Word today and give us the grit to keep it."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c13.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "and", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.58}, {"text": "let", "start": 0.58, "end": 0.7}, {"text": "us", "start": 0.7, "end": 0.88}, {"text": "taste", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.28}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.28, "end": 2.0}, {"text": "reward", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.44}, {"text": "you", "start": 2.44, "end": 2.88}, {"text": "promised.", "start": 2.88, "end": 3.32}, {"text": "In", "start": 4.26, "end": 5.04}, {"text": "Jesus'", "start": 5.04, "end": 5.42}, {"text": "name,", "start": 5.52, "end": 5.82}, {"text": "amen.", "start": 6.0, "end": 6.66}], "text": "and let us taste the reward you promised. In Jesus' name, amen."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c14.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Follow", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.76}, {"text": "blessed", "start": 0.76, "end": 1.04}, {"text": "prayers", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.52}, {"text": "so", "start": 1.52, "end": 2.28}, {"text": "the", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.46}, {"text": "word", "start": 2.46, "end": 2.76}, {"text": "finds", "start": 2.76, "end": 3.16}, {"text": "you", "start": 3.16, "end": 3.5}, {"text": "on", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.92}, {"text": "the", "start": 3.92, "end": 4.02}, {"text": "hard", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.28}, {"text": "days.", "start": 4.28, "end": 4.72}, {"text": "Drop", "start": 5.5, "end": 6.1}, {"text": "an", "start": 6.1, "end": 6.26}, {"text": "amen.", "start": 6.26, "end": 6.48}], "text": "Follow blessed prayers so the word finds you on the hard days. Drop an amen."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c15.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Keep", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.96}, {"text": "the", "start": 0.96, "end": 1.14}, {"text": "word", "start": 1.14, "end": 1.4}, {"text": "for", "start": 1.4, "end": 2.26}, {"text": "today.", "start": 2.26, "end": 2.6}, {"text": "Have", "start": 3.54, "end": 4.06}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.06, "end": 4.18}, {"text": "blessed", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.44}, {"text": "day.", "start": 4.44, "end": 4.74}], "text": "Keep the word for today. Have a blessed day."}}